<title>USA: Lowe's Dec same-store sales up 4 pct.</title>
<headline>Lowe's Dec same-store sales up 4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH WILKESBORO, N.C. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lowe's Companies Inc</p>
<p>					     5 Weeks Ended:</p>
<p>			     Jan. 3, 1997	 Jan. 5, 1996</p>
<p>			Change   Sales     Mix	 Sales	Mix</p>
<p>Total Sales	  + 18%   $808.3   100%	$686.8     100%</p>
<p>Comparable</p>
<p> Stores(A) 330     +  4%   $670.9    83%	$647.8	94%</p>
<p>(A) Stores open more than one year with comparable square footage.</p>
</text>
